			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r1302_dancer_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>Hey, Trainer!
Check out my moves!▼
Have you gone to the next city yet?
I learned this move at the▽
musical over there.▽
Pretty cool, isn't it?▼
ヤー　とれーなーサン
ミーノ　むーぶ　ミテクダサーイ▼
ツギノ　マチニ　イキマシタカ？▼
アソコノ　みゅーじかるデ
コノ　むーぶ　マナビマシタ！▼
カッコイイデショ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:04:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>Hey, Trainer!
Check out my moves!▼
Have you gone to the next city yet?
I learned this move at the▽
musical over there.▽
Pretty cool, isn't it?▼
ヤー　とれーなーサン
ミーノ　むーぶ　ミテクダサーイ▼
ツギノ　マチニ　イキマシタカ？▼
アソコノ　みゅーじかるデ
コノ　むーぶ　マナビマシタ！▼
カッコイイデショ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:04:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：英語
・よう　トレーナー！
　おれの動き見てみろよ！
　もう次の街には行った？
　そこのミュージカルで
　この動き習ったんだよ
　かっこいいだろ？
※swanで日本語部分追加</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:02:46" />
		</CommentCell>
