	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r1302_trainerw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>Hi there.
Having a good time?▼
You don't have to be shy.
Feel free to talk to anyone.▼
エット……▼
どんどん　はなしかけてね！
ってこと　いいました</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:05:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>Hi there.
Having a good time?▼
You don't have to be shy.
Feel free to talk to anyone.▼
エット……▼
どんどん　はなしかけてね！
ってこと　いいました</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:05:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：英語
・やあ　こんにちは
　楽しんでる？
　はずかしがらなくていいんだよ
　いろんな人に話しかけてみなよ
※swanで日本語部分追加</Comment>
